<title>USA: Sodak Gaming Inc Q1 net off, revs rise.</title>
<headline>Sodak Gaming Inc Q1 net off, revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>RAPID CITY, S.D. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter</p>
<p>							  1997   1996 %</p>
<p>								    Change</p>
<p>Revenue</p>
<p>   Product sales				     11.4  14.5</p>
<p>   Wide area progressive systems		  2.4   1.8</p>
<p>   Domestic gaming operations		     8.0   2.1</p>
<p>   International gaming operations		5.5   1.7</p>
<p>   Financing income and other		     1.8   1.5</p>
<p>     Total revenue				   29.1  21.6   35%</p>
<p> Costs and expenses				  27.6  17.3   60%</p>
<p> Income from operations			     1.5   4.3 (65%)</p>
<p> Other income					   0.5    --</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes		     2.0   4.3</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes			 0.7   1.6</p>
<p> Net earnings					   1.3   2.7 (53%)</p>
<p> Earnings per share				  0.06  0.12</p>
<p>Note: Earnings per share figures reflect the two-for-one stock split effective September 27, 1996 for all reporting periods.</p>
<p>($ amounts in millions, except earnings per share)</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
